        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions FII-SD-CFRBAC-14 14 Inch Clear Acrylic Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>Made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest clear acrylic available. The acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading.  These are great pulls for glass shower doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/acrylic-9-inch-shower-door-pull-pair-first-impressions-sd-pcf100009sbr\"><b>9 Inch Clear Acrylic Shower Door Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FII-SD-CFRBAC-14 Clear Acrylic Shower Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Holes in Glass Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These glass door clear acrylic pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 3 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pull handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
